              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Nyakati 17:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana takuna malaika ariyeambwa ni Mlungu maneno higa arigoambira Jesu, “Uwe u Mwanangu, rero nikakala sowe.” Na Mlungu kagombere kuhusu malaika yeyesi akaamba, “Mimi ndakala ise, naye andakala mwanangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 32:43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona Mlungu ariphokala anamreha Mwanawe mvyere duniani, waamba, “Malaika osi a Mlungu ni amuabudu hiye Mwana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
